    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nBerlin\nPolice sergeant crashes cruiser on I-89 in Berlin\nBy Daniel Duric,\n4 hours agoBERLIN — A Vermont State Police sergeant crashed his cruiser after hydroplaning on Interstate 89 North early Monday morning. Sgt. Benjamin Katz, 45, of Burlington, failed to maintain his lane of travel when his 2017 Ford Explorer hydroplaned during heavy rain at approximately 3:28 a.m. The single-vehicle crash occurred...\n1",
